  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funguo Innovation Programme - ICF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUNGUO aims to contribute towards increasing the number of successfully scaled innovative ventures which address the SDGs, including those targeting the climate. It does so by addressing the challenges and gaps in the innovation ecosystem that hinder the scaling of innovative impact ventures. This component will support climate smart innovations in line with agreed ICF indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
